✅ 6. Production Notes
Concern	Recommendation
Docker Management	Use Docker Compose, healthchecks, volume mounts for persistence
Performance	Use batching, caching, and async chunk processing
Model Serving	Run Ollama with GPU if available, or move to dedicated LLM service
Logging & Errors	Use Winston or Pino logging, and robust error retries
Monitoring	Prometheus/Grafana or basic health-check endpoints

